- 15 boxes Sparkling Catawba;

15 do Dry do;
60 do Catawba Brandy;

1000 gallons Dry Catawba—the cheapest and best
Dinner Wine used.
Just received and for sale by S. H. LOOMS CO,
Sole Agents, AZ Public Square, Nashville.

I WILL sell at public sale, TO the highest
bidder, at the residence of Charles Ridenhour,
near Martinsburg, on SATURDAY March Sd,
1855, the following

1 lot of property consisting of:
10 head Of Cattle; Horses; Colts;
10 head Of Hogs; Wagons and Wagon beds;
Bershear ploughs; Harrow;

3 Double and Single Shovel Ploughs;
sets Of Clears; Wheat Fan;

1 Cutting Box; Wheel Barrow;
Grindstone; 1 Digging IRON;

Mattocks; Grain Cradles;

Rakes; Forks; Shovels; Hoes, &c.,
2 Mowing Scythes and Snathes; Axes;
Cooking Stove and APPARATUS complete;
template Stove and Pipe; Cupboards;
Bureaus; 1 dozen Chairs; Clock;
Beds, Beds; Bedsteads and Bedding;
1 lot Tubs, Buckets, Barrels, Hogsheads, &c.;
1 lot Queas, Glass, China and Crockery
Ware; 1 lot Of Carpet, &c.,
levied upon to satisfy sundry executions in my
hands against him.

TERMS—A credit of six months will be allowed
purchasers, with note and approved security
bearing interest from day of sale. No property
to be removed until the terms are strictly com
plied with. J. VAN YANSDALE,
Deputy for J. VAN DOREN, jr., late Sheriff

of Berkeley County
February 1A, 1855.

Arrive Anscosia same day by pm;
$3.50 From Mount Airy to Damascus, 10 miles and back, a week.

Leave Mount Airy Saturday at 10 am;
Arrive at Damascus same day by pm;
Leave Damascus Saturday at 11 am;
Arrive Mount Airy same day by 4 pm.

$3.50 From East New Market to Crotchett's Ferry, in Dorchester county, 15 miles and back, once a week.
Leave East New Market Saturday at 8 am;
Arrive at Crotchett's Ferry same day by 10 am;
Leave Crotchett's Ferry Saturday at 11 am;
Arrive at East New Market same day by 1 pm.

$3.50 From Snow Hill, by Nassango Furnace, to Princess Ann 21 miles and back, once a week.
Leave Snow Hill Tuesday at 8 am;
Arrive at Princess Ann same day by 8 pm;
Leave Princess Ann Wednesday at 3 pm;
Arrive at Snow Hill same day by pm.

$3.50 From White Haven to Realsville, (in Somerset county,) 12 miles and back, once a week.
Bidders will state the distance, and propose schedule of departures and arrivals.

$3.50 From Cambridge to Buckstown 10 miles and back once a week.

Leave Cambridge Wednesday at 8 am;
Arrive at Buckstown by 10 am;
Leave Buckstown Wednesday at 1 pm;
Arrive at Cambridge same day by 4 pm.

$3.50 From Glen Rock by Hericks or Kroh's Mills, to Manchester 15 miles and back three times a week.

Leave Glen Rock Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday at 10 am;
Arrive Manchester same days by pm;
Leave Manchester same days at 1 pm;
Arrive Glen Rock same days by 5 pm.
Proposals for six-times-a-week service will be considered.
